	(text "HOLD-OFF (D064): while RST is high this transistor holds X at 0 V through 100 ohm: the Schmitt trigger reads low and the clock gate holds CLK low.  When RST lets go, the card's own reset or the panel's button, X charges from 0 V and the first clock edge comes 1.3 to 5.4 ms later at the fastest setting, never in the 45 us in which the cards leave their resets"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 563.88 0)
